tent":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jimborg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/18172-glitch-values#post18172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I was looking at the KS copy of Demon, I noticed that in the Primum chart that all Demons start with 5 glitches. Now, does this refer to 5 individual glitches, or glitches whose value totals up to 5, similar to the values assigned in the section dealing with pacts, i.e. a minor glitch would be worth 1 point of glitch, major would be 2 and catastrophic would be worth 3?</div> </div> </div> </div>Line overflow happened. Chart actually reads: <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">Primum</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Attribute/Skill Max</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Max Aether/Max Aether Per Turn</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Max Covers</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">Glitches</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">10/1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">0</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">11/2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">0</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\">3</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">5</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\">12/3</td> <td class=\"